OL,3,AHomemade bombs part of alleged plot on
OL,4,AManchester's Jewish community, court
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo Iranian men have appeared in court
OL,8,Fcharged with terror offences over an
OL,9,Falleged plot to target the Jewish
OL,10,Fcommunity in Manchester with a homemade
OL,11,Fbomb.
OL,13,FRahman Salehi, 34, of Salford, and
OL,14,FSalam Ahmadyan, 36, from Liverpool,
OL,15,Fwere accused at Westminster
OL,16,FMagistrates' Court of preparing to
OL,17,Fcommit an act of terrorism or assisting
OL,18,Fanother to commit an act of terrorism
OL,19,Fon or before 20 September.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
